1
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,900
Cold chair against my spine.

2
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,000
Hands wet with quiet fear.

3
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:20,300
A shadow steps right out.

4
00:00:20,899 --> 00:00:25,100
A warm face draws so near.

5
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:33,700
One, two, three, just breathe.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,799
Step, side, close, don't fall.

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,899
Warm fingers hold my hand.

8
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:46,100
Ice melts inside the hall.

9
00:00:53,399 --> 00:00:57,000
I stare down at her shoes.

10
00:00:57,399 --> 00:01:01,100
Afraid to make a slip.

11
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:05,500
Look up at me, she says.

12
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:10,000
A soft smile on her lip.

13
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:14,599
One, two, three, just breathe.

14
00:01:14,799 --> 00:01:18,599
Step, side, close, don't fall.

15
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:22,799
Warm fingers hold my hand.

16
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:27,000
Ice melts inside the hall.

17
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:33,900
No judgment in her eyes.

18
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:38,099
My frozen shoulders drop.

19
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:42,400
The panic melts away.

20
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:47,099
The numbers finally stop.

21
00:01:49,099 --> 00:01:53,000
One, two, three, and breathe.

22
00:01:53,299 --> 00:01:57,099
Safe on the wooden floor.

23
00:01:57,400 --> 00:02:01,599
I take a quiet step.

24
00:02:01,900 --> 00:02:06,599
Not hiding anymore.